// PPU (Cell PPE, PowerPC 64 + AltiVec) instruction list.
//
// OP(Enum, "mnemonic", "operands", flags, primary opcode, form, extended opcode)
//
// Forms:  PRIM  primary opcode only        DS   (i & 3)            MD  ((i >> 2) & 7)
//         MDS   ((i >> 1) & 15)            X10  ((i >> 1) & 0x3FF) X9  ((i >> 1) & 0x1FF), OE at bit 10
//         XS    ((i >> 2) & 0x1FF)         A5   ((i >> 1) & 31)
// Flags:  F_RC record bit (i & 1) . F_OE overflow bit . F_LK link bit . F_AA absolute bit
//
// Operand tokens (used by the disassembler):
//   D S A B   GPR rt / rs / ra / rb      A0  ra, printed as 0 when ra == 0
//   fD fA fB fC  FPR fields              vD vA vB vC  vector fields
//   SI UI     16-bit immediates          d(A0) ds(A0)  memory operands
//   crfD crfS L TO BO BI crbD crbA crbB SH MB ME SH6 MB6 SPR CRM FM TGT UIMM5 SIMM5 SHB
//
// VMX (primary 4) ops are listed separately in ppu_vmx_ops.inc.

